<description>&lt;p&gt;Bomb blasts near the Colombia-Venezuela border wounded at least four police officers, including a device near Cúcuta's main bridge. Former Cúcuta security chief Miguel Castellanos was shot dead in a political assassination. An extortion-linked assault in Colombia killed at least six people. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPc1ZSZlJhZnhXbWtIVDhwaTZWeGVLQlo5LVhGZ3kzcnVicUQ5dXVEOFNCWDlZcHR6M2YyV2NVN0pCTGphYy1sTlpLbXp0dXB5ekk0c0p2Z1A5N3AxVTB6dGVxajVKLTJHcGFiVW82a21HenJTdkQzcndRV21uaXc5R1ZTWk9JVlUwU3B2OVlyYVNSakZ3d0JVcWRPY3pzcG94UlJXZGd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Arabiya English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQRFlERVJxSk5wQXdCVlJDWXh1VnBVWmtzZjJrZ3lIS19jRl9XN1lMYVN4M2pGMlc4ZnVnQUtWOEVGeEdWMC15eHd0REF3UUpmT2tvblZYb09kV0RxU2pEQld4Q3B2QUNLTWRuUHpxVmpnVlpId05oNUdhaUdqSndUMlVBeDNIeWZFaWIwMkpwREI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Sun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTFBJd1hDQ215VXFMZGV6cEl6OFZTc01Bc1ZIQUtjQ0s4c3hhTVpBUlFDTGhOYVQ4ZnB1VjgtcGxjeWx4dmtHUFJaeUNZVjl5VlBReEx1NDJFUkpjY0g5V21odkp1MURXUF9x?oc=5&quot;&gt;World Socialist Web Site&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPWm1KbXZzWU9pendiZ1RqZ19mLTl2UTNSZS10WGVHQVJNTkRtNUhqNThVbWZ2djZfRDRVZjFaRmJ5TVEtbm9VdVZXenBVb1NLWWt5ZVQ5S2h3ZC1NQzc5V2xpdW9yOEtoMkJITXRmZ1pCYVI3c2hONkdfWGNNaE51b2x0OUVUdGljNWtBaE5jTVdNaG14LWhYZnBWdDNJbmstWDRqaXJSeXVhRWY5YU5DcDNwYTBMczRB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tampa Free Press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQb3VCQlRBQ2lXMkhHWENhZ3l2bFBkeU9qakd1dXVTRWZDU1NoR09UQ09GNU1TTDVLeDNBQzBobWdsRDFDN09rTTRpXzBUVElNZ0RkVTk